flow of the game

players turn starts:
roll some Dice (if you roll higher than a 3 draw 2 cards)
take a card (some cards move your character, some cards bring a wandering
trader or store, some have a battle, some you have scenarios and some you find items and some you lose gold)


battle flow:
roll a 3 or higher to attack, anything lower you skip
enemy does same

if you CAN attack then you roll a 12 sided dye for damage

when an enemy attacks its enemydamageroll - playerdefense for total damage

you win money and xp from battles and your level goes up


